3 XI. The department may authorize each operator of an alternative treatment center
4 registered under RSA 126-X:7 to operate an additional cultivation location, which shall be a
5 greenhouse, and which shall be subject to rules adopted by the department under RSA 126-X:6, III,
6 and all applicable provisions of this chapter, including, but not limited to, compliance with local
7 zoning laws. The department shall, in conjunction with the local governing body of the town or city
8 where the additional cultivation location would be located, solicit input from qualifying patients,
9 designated caregivers, and residents of the town or city in which the additional cultivation location
10 wouldbelocated.
